EN:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}The snowy landscape is great, huh?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}I think I fell in love with {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
thanks to the snow,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Il paesaggio innevato è meraviglioso.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Io mi sono innamorato di {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
in un giorno di neve,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Eine tolle Schneelandschaft, oder?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0004:}}Ich glaube, ich hab mich in das
winterliche {{TAG:0005:0005:}} verliebt{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.

{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Im Winter sind zwar alle Städte
weiß, aber sie sehen trotzdem alle
unterschiedlich aus{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}I-{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}I'm not a suspicious character
at all!{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0025:}}I'm just {{TAG:0005:0001:}}!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Man, putting yourself through harsh,
cold conditions,{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} it'll make you wild.
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I read that somewhere{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}That's why I came to {{TAG:0005:0005:}}
for some winter camping!

ES:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}}¿Dónde viviré más a gusto?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}} ¿Junto
a la zona de las tiendas para
disfrutar del ambientillo?{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
¿O cerca del mar para estar más
tranquilo? Puede que pase frío en
invierno si construyo mi casa allí{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

IT:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Dove potrei costruire la mia casa?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
Vicino a Via degli Acquisti per
non perdere la movida del centro?
O vicino al mare? Lì sarebbe bello,
ma d'inverno potrebbe fare
un po' troppo freddo per me{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Maceracı hayatın tadına varıp biraz kış kampı için
buraya gelmek{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} hoş olur diye düşündüm{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ama galiba bu benim için biraz fazla
maceracı oldu?{{TAG:0007:0000:20000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Hah ha!

{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Bazen böyle karın ortasında kamp yapıp maceracı
hayatın tadını çıkarmak güzel,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}. {{TAG:0003:0006:}}Uyku tulumu bile
olmadan karda yatacak kadar cesur musun?{{TAG:0007:0001:}} {{TAG:0003:0026:}}Hah ha!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
Şaka yapıyorum!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}Nachdem ich eine Weile in
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} gecampt hab, ist mir
etwas klar geworden{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0006:}}Ich kann es nicht beschreiben, aber{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
irgendwas in dieser Stadt strahlt
eine gewisse Magie auf mich aus.{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Zieh doch hierher!
Das bildest du dir ein.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Nedense{{TAG:0007:0000:10000000}} bugün biri bana bakıyormuş
gibi hissediyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:000F:}}
Bu bir işaret olabilir mi{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:04000000}}belki
{{TAG:0005:0005:}} {{TAG:0003:0017:}}burada yaşamamı istiyordur?{{TAG:000F:0005:15002800}}
Bence öyle!
Bence değil.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I think you should really be a bit
more proud of your own town,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}This is a special town.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}At least for me it is!

IT:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Credo che dovresti essere più
orgoglios{{TAG:000E:0006:02006F0002006100}} della tua città,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}È un posto speciale.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Beh, almeno per me, s'intende!

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Du solltest deine Heimatstadt ein
bisschen mehr zu schätzen wissen,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Das ist eine ganz besondere Stadt.{{TAG:0007:0001:}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Zumindest für mich!
